Technical aspect: What signal is hidden in this 'pin bar'?

K-line pattern: This sharp drop K-line directly smashed through the recent support level, and it is a combination of 'long lower shadow + large bearish candle', indicating that although there is some capital bottom-fishing during the decline, the selling pressure is clearly stronger;
